# ============================================================================
# GIT LFS — SOURCE MASTERS ONLY
# ============================================================================
#
# One rule, one file, by exact name — deliberately NOT `*.mp4`.
#
# This repository holds two kinds of video and they must not share a storage
# strategy:
#
#   PRODUCTION  interactive-deck/public/demo/*.mp4  (~1.0MB for all six)
#               interactive-deck/public/intro.mp4   (91KB)
#               Ordinary Git objects. They are the browser payload, they are
#               small on purpose, and they must stay in a plain clone so a
#               build never depends on an LFS fetch.
#
#   MASTER      demo final.mp4                      (42MB)
#               The client's raw screen recording. Kept for source
#               preservation, re-cutting and future chapter extraction — never
#               served. Git stores a pointer; LFS stores the binary.
#
# `[[:space:]]` is Git LFS's own escape for the space in the filename. Do not
# hand-edit it. To add another master, use `git lfs track "<path>"` so the
# escaping stays correct.
demo[[:space:]]final.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
